msgid ""
"The goal of Installation is not to run a specific LLM, but to confirm that "
"the software stack and NPU backend are ready."
msgstr "Installation 的目标不是跑一个具体 LLM，而是确认软件栈和 NPU backend 已准备好。"

msgid ""
"The [Quickstart](quick_start.md) covers the model-level inference smoke "
"test."
msgstr "模型级 inference smoke test 由 [Quickstart](quick_start.md) 负责。"

msgid "#### 1. Check the Devices"
msgstr "#### 1. 检查设备"

msgid ""
"If Docker `--device` already restricts the visible devices, you generally do"
" not need to set both visibility variables as well."
msgstr "如果 Docker `--device` 已经限制了可见设备，一般不需要再同时设置两个 visibility 变量。"

msgid "#### 2. Check the Core Software and NPU Backend"
msgstr "#### 2. 检查核心软件和 NPU backend"

msgid "Then run:"
msgstr "然后运行："

msgid "The minimum criteria for installation readiness are:"
msgstr "安装准备完成的最低标准："

msgid ""
"- the host / current runtime environment can detect the NPU;\n"
"    - `torch.npu.is_available()` succeeds;\n"
"    - the simple NPU tensor operation passes;\n"
"    - the vLLM Ascend plugin is registered;\n"
"    - there are no unresolved core software dependency conflicts."
msgstr ""
"- Host / 当前运行环境可以看到 NPU；\n"
"    - `torch.npu.is_available()` 成功；\n"
"    - 简单 NPU tensor operation 通过；\n"
"    - vLLM Ascend plugin 已注册；\n"
"    - 没有未处理的核心软件依赖冲突。"

msgid ""
"After meeting these criteria, proceed to the [Quickstart](quick_start.md) "
"and run the first model for your hardware."
msgstr "达到这些条件后，继续 [Quickstart](quick_start.md) 运行硬件对应的第一个模型。"
